jp-subsidies
============

This plugin calls the jGrants (Jグランツ) public Web-API operated for the
Japanese government subsidy portal. Use of that API is subject to the
jGrants Web-API terms (API利用規約) and the published call limit
(10 requests / 1 second in the API利用概要).

- Portal: https://www.jgrants-portal.go.jp/
- Open API page: https://www.jgrants-portal.go.jp/open-api
- API terms (PDF): https://fs2.jgrants-portal.go.jp/API%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E8%A6%8F%E7%B4%84.pdf
- API overview (PDF): https://fs2.jgrants-portal.go.jp/API%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E6%A6%82%E8%A6%81.pdf
- API docs: https://developers.digital.go.jp/documents/jgrants/api/

Required attribution when showing subsidy data (terms 第5条1項一 example):
  出典：J グランツ

Plugin code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE). Offline fixtures under
tests/fixtures/ are trimmed from public jGrants API responses (attachment
bytes replaced with a tiny placeholder).

